WEBVTT

00:00:00.727 --> 00:00:02.505
<b>Strangers on a Train</b>

00:00:03.779 --> 00:00:04.623
<b>Part 1</b>

00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:29.141
When the train stopped at the station, I opened my eyes and looked out of the window.

00:00:30.002 --> 00:00:32.268
I saw a woman on the platform.

00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:36.083
She was tall and blonde with blue eyes.

00:00:38.464 --> 00:00:41.240
The train moved and I closed my eyes.

00:00:44.788 --> 00:00:47.913
It was 4.00 p.m. and the train was full.

00:00:50.397 --> 00:00:53.136
Excuse me. Can I sit here?

00:00:53.996 --> 00:00:58.352
I opened my eyes again. It was the tall, blonde woman.

00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:00.967
‘Sure,’ I answered.

00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:09.162
She sat down next to me. There was a nice smell. Chanel Number 5.

00:01:11.561 --> 00:01:14.261
I started to listen to music on my phone.

00:01:23.035 --> 00:01:24.185
I love Chopin.

00:01:24.926 --> 00:01:26.615
‘Sorry?’ I said.

00:01:27.674 --> 00:01:31.680
You’re listening to Chopin. I love classical music.

00:01:32.464 --> 00:01:35.766
She smiled. Her eyes were very blue.

00:01:36.492 --> 00:01:40.711
We talked about music until the train arrived at Paddington Station.

00:01:45.933 --> 00:01:49.459
‘Would you like a cup of coffee?’ she asked me.

00:01:50.353 --> 00:01:54.370
I looked at my watch. ‘OK’, I said.

00:01:54.856 --> 00:01:55.764
‘I have time.’